<title>MALTA: PRESS DIGEST - Malta - Feb 27.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Malta - Feb 27.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are the leading stories in the Maltese press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>THE TIMES</p>
<p>- U.S. firm takes over Merit-Malta.</p>
<p>- Controller of Bical Bank says not enough funds available yet to meet bank's liabilities.</p>
<p>L-ORIZZONT</p>
<p>- Malta faces waste disposal problem.</p>
<p>IN-NAZZJON</p>
<p>- Government rejects proposals to fine-tune VAT.</p>
</text>
